- RBAC: <https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/access-authn-authz/rbac/> · <https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/security/rbac-good-practices/>
- Secret·etcd 암호화: <https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/configuration/secret/> · <https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/administer-cluster/encrypt-data/>
- Sealed Secrets: <https://github.com/bitnami/sealed-secrets>
- NetworkPolicy: <https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/services-networking/network-policies/>
- 워크로드: <https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/workloads/controllers/deployment/> · <https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/workloads/controllers/statefulset/> · <https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/workloads/controllers/daemonset/>
- Probes: <https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/probes/>
- HPA·Metrics: <https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/workloads/autoscaling/horizontal-pod-autoscale/>
- 스토리지: <https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/storage/persistent-volumes/> · <https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/storage/storage-classes/>
- PDB: <https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/disruptions/>
- Quota·LimitRange: <https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/policy/resource-quotas/> · <https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/policy/limit-range/>
- Operator·도구: <https://prometheus-operator.dev/docs/api-reference/api/> · <https://cert-manager.io/docs/usage/certificate/> · <https://kyverno.io/docs/policy-types/cluster-policy/validate/>

## 출제 예측 근거

- **C가 최다 출제 예상**: 검증 포인트는 "이해하고 결정했는가" — 우리 구성(PSA 레벨 배치, Vault 1 vs Alertmanager 3, StatefulSet 선택, 실측 기반 수치)의 "왜"를 물을 확률이 가장 높음. 특히 C1은 정정된 내용으로 답할 것.
- **B는 고전 구분 문제**: RBAC 4조합(특히 Role+CRB 불가), PV/PVC 방향, base64≠암호화가 단골.
- **D는 "그럼 그거 없으면/틀리면 어떻게 되는데요?" 패턴**: 각 오브젝트의 부재·오설정 시나리오를 답할 수 있어야 꼬리질문에서 안 무너짐.
